    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## AI as a College Admissions Officer\r\n\r\n**1. Attach Resources:** Click [_Add File_] and then [_From Library_], and select PDF file that contains information about the student applications that you reviewed.\r\n\r\n**2. Ask :** Interview the AI Chatbot to determine which students it would admit and why.\r\n\r\n**3. Document:** Find the section in your Activity Guide called \"AI’s Selections\" and answer the questions.\r\n",
